<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44165" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαμπ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>well-bent</i> or <i>curved</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.368
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληῗδ᾽ εὐκαμπέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλάσασ᾽ εὐκαμπέα τόξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					27.12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτρον, ἅρπη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.
				458
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1388
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαμπὴς τὰ κέρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMar.</u>
					15.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ. τῶν μελῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Im.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>flexible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοιός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.10.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					15.1.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκευάζειν τὸ κέρας
			εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; of timber, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.19.2
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦον</span>
			<i>slippery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>. (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαμπὲς ἄγκιστρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.4
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>) is corrupt: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκᾰπές
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπτω</span>) <i>easily
				swallowed</i>, Salm.)</div>
